        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='14'>Profit by Discount Band</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI'>40%+ discount band wipes out nearly $100K in profit.</run>
          </formatted-text>
