                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffb300' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='8'>⚠️ Cap discounts at 20%</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#eaf4ff' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='8'>Margin falls below break-even after aggressive discounting. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#eaf4ff' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='8'>Limit discounts to protect profitability.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
